# nocheck: persona-block-rationale — the wiki's bureaucrat/sysop is a local account created by maintenance/run.php createAndPromote (vars/main.yml MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD, tasks/04_admin.yml); $wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin is false so no native form accepts it, and $wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName lands the Keycloak identity on a separate e-mail-named wiki account with no sysop rights (see README "Persona contract opt-outs").
